\description{
Functions for creating and handling custom reapi-specific conditions, including errors, warnings, and messages.
\itemize{
\item \code{reapi_abort()}: creates a condition representing an error and when thrown, aborts execution.
\item \code{reapi_warn()}: creates a condition representing a warning condition
