These functions wrap \code{\link[cli:cli_abort]{cli::cli_abort()}}, \code{\link[cli:cli_warn]{cli::cli_warn()}}, and \code{\link[cli:cli_inform]{cli::cli_inform()}} respectively,
adding \code{reapi}-specific context and class names (\verb{reapi_*}) to the condition objects for
downstream handling and identification.
